{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the gritty world of <strong>XGUN</strong>, an intense PvEvP extraction shooter developed by the independent <strong>Kasit Studio</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little remains of the world we once knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/661ae49bd71446507b29267db32113a7.avif?t=1750779969\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras_big/661ae49bd71446507b29267db32113a7.avif?t=1750779969 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/7ebf568eefa2f29754b82d4def5231d4.poster.avif?t=1750779969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/7ebf568eefa2f29754b82d4def5231d4.webm?t=1750779969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/7ebf568eefa2f29754b82d4def5231d4.mp4?t=1750779969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character, learn the basics, choose your missions, and enter the horrific environment of <strong>KIES Island</strong>, where random weather and time of day add to the challenge. Face off against other players, zombies, animals, and creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot valuable items, craft gear, customize your weapons, and prepare for extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/eef9a9aaa4ca715ba04a72eb4d56cb0b.poster.avif?t=1750779969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/eef9a9aaa4ca715ba04a72eb4d56cb0b.webm?t=1750779969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/eef9a9aaa4ca715ba04a72eb4d56cb0b.mp4?t=1750779969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTRACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death means mission failure and the loss of everything you brought with you. Escape by boat before something\u2014or someone\u2014kills you. After all, you\u2019ll return to your beloved hub island!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/f020fcb2cac1db21817a783dfeef0d74.poster.avif?t=1750779969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/f020fcb2cac1db21817a783dfeef0d74.webm?t=1750779969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/extras/f020fcb2cac1db21817a783dfeef0d74.mp4?t=1750779969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new items, unlock upgrades, and rest in the hub. Go to the gym and train your character, choose new missions, and head back to <strong>KIES Island</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid: Play in a 20-player match with 5 squads of 4 Survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Split-Screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE Only.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, tactical, hardcore FPS mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge focus on gunplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable HUD.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced crafting system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced inventory system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emote system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tacti-cool gear: lasers, tactical lights, night vision...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed, large map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 animals, 10 creatures, and 15 zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2828620?t=1750779969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2828620?t=1750779969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750779969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750779969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descript