</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Split-Screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE Only.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, tactical, hardcore FPS mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge focus on gunplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable HUD.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced crafting system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced inventory system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emote system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tacti-cool gear: lasers, tactical lights, night vision...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed, large map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 animals, 10 creatures, and 15 zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Kasit studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828620/header.jpg?t=1750779969","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2828620/778841/84bd671a67db8b79a2cb161574cf3d1c7a482952/1750945352/dash_av1.mpd?t=1730210218","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2828620/778841/84bd671a67db8b79a2cb161574cf3d1c7a482952/1750945352/dash_h264.mpd?t=1730210218","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2828620/778841/84bd671a67db8b79a2cb161574cf3d1c7a482952/1750945352/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1730210218","id":257069386,"name":"XGUN PRE-ALPHA Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257069386/cefad52f851a6b34c850ffcde72a44ba7eb868eb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730210218"}],"name":"XGUN","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum: